title: The settlement decision
view-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.pending(Q)==='cyprus_geneva_deadline'; !}
new-page: true

= [+ cyprus_date_display +] — The settlement decision

The delegations must decide whether an agreement is ready. A federal settlement requires support from all three foreign delegations and sufficient progress on security guarantees. Further military action remains a separate political decision.

- @denktas: Conclude the Denktaş federal settlement.
- @gunes: Conclude the Güneş canton settlement.
- @constitution: Accept restoration of the constitutional order.
- @second: Authorize Atilla II.
- @division: Accept the historical division.

@denktas
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.canSettle(Q,'denktas'); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires all three endorsements and the military, UN, airport and diplomatic conditions.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.settle(Q,'Denktaş Plan'); !}
go-to: cyprus_campaign_final

@gunes
choose-if: {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.canSettle(Q,'gunes'); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires all three endorsements, three conference breakthroughs and strong UN cooperation.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.settle(Q,'Güneş Plan'); !}
go-to: cyprus_campaign_final

@constitution
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.settle(Q,'Return to the 1960 Constitutional Order'); !}
go-to: cyprus_campaign_final

@second
choose-if: cyprus_atilla2_complete == 0 and cyprus_month == 8 and cyprus_day == 14
unavailable-subtitle: The second operation can only be authorized on August 14, before it has already occurred.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.beginII(Q); !}
go-to: cyprus_atilla2_14

@division
choose-if: cyprus_atilla2_complete == 1
unavailable-subtitle: This outcome is available only after Atilla II.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.settle(Q,'Historical Division'); !}
go-to: cyprus_campaign_final
